partial       | took L from bag, drop L, end, drop R
cond true     | drop cond-a, consumed 6, scope end, drop cond-b
cond false    | scope end, drop cond-b, drop cond-a
tuple pat     | bound t0, drop t0, drop t1, drop t2
ref pat       | ref u1, drop u0, drop u1
take loop     | iter 0 got slot, drop slot, iter 1 empty, iter 2 empty
move closure  | call closure, call closure, drop closure, closure dropped
into_iter     | first v0, drop v1, drop v2, iter dropped, drop v0
reassign      | drop br, reassigned, destructured bl, drop bl, drop br2
tuple struct _| kept duo0, drop duo0, drop duo1
struct update | derived new-l base-r base, drop new-l, drop base-r, drop base-l
